{"id":273,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Seedot looks exactly like an acorn when it is dangling from a tree branch. It startles other Pokémon by suddenly moving. This Pokémon polishes its body once a day using leaves."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Seedot attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. It sucks moisture from the tree while hanging off the branch. The more water it drinks, the glossier this Pokémon’s body becomes."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"If it remains still, it becomes impossible to distinguish from real nuts. It delights in surprising foraging PIDGEY."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It hangs off branches and absorbs nutrients. When it finishes eating, its body becomes so heavy that it drops to the ground with a thump."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Pickpocket","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon steals the held item from attackers that made direct contact with it."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":273,"name":"Seedot","condition":null,"children":[{"id":274,"name":"Nuzleaf","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":275,"name":"Shiftry","condition":"Use Leaf Stone"